# The packages the Codespace of shuuchuu/labs installs: those Colab preinstalls that
# the notebooks without a GPU import, at Colab's versions. requirements.txt is this
# list compiled against Colab's own package list: after editing it, run
# `uv run python labs/scripts/colab_requirements.py` in shuuchuu/slides (see its
# labs/README.md, "Codespaces"). A package Colab lacks is installed by the notebook
# itself (`!pip install`), as in Colab: don't list it here.
